---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  page_description: "Privacy Policy for Aerospace UAE.",
  canonical_url: "/legal/privacy"
};
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" seo={seo}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: March 2024</p>
    <p>At Aerospace UAE, we take your privacy seriously. This policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your B2B data.</p>
    <h2>Data Collection</h2>
    <p>We collect information you provide directly to us via forms (e.g., directory registration, newsletter signup). This may include your name, work email, and company details.</p>
    <h2>Data Usage</h2>
    <p>Your data is used to provide the services you requested, such as directory listings or newsletters. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>We implement standard security measures to protect your data. Form submissions are handled securely via our designated capture infrastructure.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
